{#-
  local_freq.j2
  The number of frequency IDs each X-engine GPU processes. pathfinder.j2 sizes the pipeline
  with it and recv.j2 sizes the DTV products it receives, so both import it from here.
  Must be divisible by 4 because pl_mask shapes use num_local_freq/4.
  This file renders to nothing and is not a config by itself.
-#}
{% set num_local_freq = 384 %}
